SECTION XV 
BASE METALS AND ARTICLES OF BASE METAL 
NOTES : 
1. This Section does not cover : 
(a) prepared paints, inks or other products with a basis of metallic flakes or powder (headings 3207  to 
3210, 3212, 3213 or 3215); 
